This product bundles no third-party model weights. It depends on, and (at setup time) downloads,
the following projects. Keep their LICENSE/NOTICE files when redistributing, and credit each:

- Kokoro-82M (hexgrad/Kokoro-82M) .......... Apache-2.0 (model weights)  https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M
- kokoro (hexgrad/kokoro) .................. Apache-2.0 (inference lib)   https://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro
- misaki (hexgrad/misaki) .................. Apache-2.0 (G2P)             https://github.com/hexgrad/misaki
- phonemizer-fork / espeak-ng loader ....... GPL-3.0-or-later  (runtime phonemizer; see THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md)
- OpenAI Whisper weights ................... MIT                         https://github.com/openai/whisper
- whisper.cpp (ggml-org/whisper.cpp) ....... MIT (if the WASM build is used)
- transformers.js (huggingface) ............ Apache-2.0 (in-browser STT runtime)
- Parakeet TDT 0.6B (NVIDIA) ............... CC-BY-4.0 (optional STT weights; attribution required)
- FastAPI (MIT), uvicorn (BSD-3), starlette (BSD-3), numpy (BSD-3), soundfile (BSD-3), torch (BSD-3)

UX inspired by OpenWhisper (malukenho/OpenWhisper, MIT). No OpenWhisper code is used or included.

espeak-ng is NOT included in this repository or its release artifacts. Users install it separately
(brew / apt / choco install espeak-ng / official espeak-ng.msi). Model weights are likewise not included;
fetch_models.py downloads them from their original publishers at setup time.
